  ],
  "contract": "epoll(7): EPOLLONESHOT disables the descriptor only after an event is pulled out by epoll_wait. A call that failed with EFAULT pulled no event, so the next valid epoll_wait must report it.",
  "observed": "After epoll_wait returns EFAULT, the one-shot interest stays disabled and a valid retry returns 0 until EPOLL_CTL_MOD rearms it.",
